    "v039 and v040 are underdetermined and resolve to the base; the English matches.",
    "εὐξαίμην ἄν is taken as one unit on the single modal would rather than leaving ἄν unrepresented, which rule 50 names as the recurring failure; giving would to ἄν alone and leaving the optative with no English word is the competing reading.",
